{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-17T12:35:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100564273395298607"],"id":"2100564273395298607","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8823,"like_count":132,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":93,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国人的放假居然是借贷，放了之后是要还的。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100564273395298607"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-17T11:35:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100549247099982104"],"id":"2100549247099982104","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3402,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":1},"text":"在我忍不住吐露心声之后会立刻转移话题，刚把结痂抠开的下一秒意识到不行，不能这个样子，这些痛苦的细节不应该被除我之外的任何人承受\n然后直接转移话题谈论今天的饭，昨天的云，明天可能会开的花，最近看到的有趣的梗，只要砸出去的信息够多，就能快速冲淡我的软弱和痛苦","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100549247099982104"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-17T11:14:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100543947890401629"],"id":"2100543947890401629","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":18921,"like_count":523,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":270,"retweet_count":59},"text":"在某种程度上，我觉得文采是在用心咀嚼痛苦的软烂来兑换的，看着人们写出惊艳的文字为此触动的同时我其实难过也很多，因为我太明白从感受到表达这之间要再经历多少百转千回了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100543947890401629"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-17T10:37:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100534534890770720"],"id":"2100534534890770720","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2429,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每天都在因为鸡毛蒜皮的事情费心费力，舍友又要我充电费然后又不给钱，嘴上说着不在宿舍住，但实际上我一充电费她又美美回来吹空调","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100534534890770720"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-17T06:27:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100471692070141988"],"id":"2100471692070141988","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11116,"like_count":59,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":63,"retweet_count":0},"text":"老大有人给我打了50块 https://t.co/cyhzlc4gEf","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100471692070141988"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T17:30:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100276114887524394"],"id":"2100276114887524394","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":5392,"like_count":121,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":83,"retweet_count":14},"text":"令我感到痛苦的原来是爱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100276114887524394"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T17:28:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100275660908630508"],"id":"2100275660908630508","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2434,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":0},"text":"期待天降一个粘人的理想型到我身边💤","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100275660908630508"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T17:27:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100275511465509048"],"id":"2100275511465509048","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3012,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我假装漠视一切 其实我在乎的很多\n我清楚在意太多失去了好痛。\n朋友跟我说，如果命中注定在一起的人是不会错过的，可是这样的话那努力的意义是什么，那些因为痛苦而流泪的夜晚算什么呢。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100275511465509048"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T17:12:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100271617385656483"],"id":"2100271617385656483","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6049,"like_count":106,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":151,"retweet_count":9},"text":"我的痛苦已由共情能力太强变为被人质疑是否情感淡漠。由轻易让人操控情绪变为冷漠旁观置身事外。其实这种转变大概正是我曾梦寐以求的长大。我要长成大人、长成大人，长成那些所有忽视我喜怒哀乐的大人。可是过了很久当我真的不再理解向我展示的那一份份喜怒哀乐时，我依旧痛苦。我甚至分不清大开大合的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100271617385656483"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T14:40:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100233300497580336"],"id":"2100233300497580336","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11311,"like_count":110,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":82,"retweet_count":39},"text":"【5000fo纪念】谢谢你，为我掉眼泪。\n在评论区留言一些你想对我说的话，抽取10个52r，转发可参与 https://t.co/Z9IeFmwrv3","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100233300497580336"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T12:54:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100206624350875653"],"id":"2100206624350875653","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1954,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"吃了心境稳定剂感觉是因为头太痛了所以没力气计较任何事","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100206624350875653"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T12:11:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100195782234456568"],"id":"2100195782234456568","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2646,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":56,"retweet_count":1},"text":"只要我丢掉的东西够多就总会飘起来的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100195782234456568"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T10:32:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100170872166531413"],"id":"2100170872166531413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5646,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":65,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你走之后再也没人喷我一身血了呀…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100170872166531413"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T07:48:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100129806767858168"],"id":"2100129806767858168","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3220,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":1},"text":"人生若真的有竞争的话 那也一定是比谁先找到自己 https://t.co/DjfACu31uF","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2100129806767858168"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-16T07:21:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2100122906667934072"],"id":"2100122906667934072","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2405,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":4},"text":"开出的无论多少张病例在家长眼中都是无意义的废纸，以及得到一句你又变得这么极端","url":"https: